endorsed by, or a port of GoatTracker2 - it is a separate AudioWorklet engine
written in JavaScript and verified against GoatTracker2's output.

It is GPL because it builds on GPL work:

  gt2-src/ - GoatTracker v2.76 by Lasse Oorni (Cadaver) and contributors,
      GPL v2 or later. Kept in-tree as the reference implementation: the
      exporter reuses its player driver, and `make verify` diffs this
      tracker's SID register writes against gplay.c frame by frame.
      https://sourceforge.net/projects/goattracker2/

  jsSID/ - a fork of jsSID by Joe Hohertz, GPL v2, carrying reSID and TinySID
      lineage (Dag Lem; Tammo Hinrichs and Rainer Sinsch). Loaded as a git
      submodule and providing the SID emulation the tracker plays through.
      https://github.com/joakimeriksson/jsSID

